;
; How Satchel files one package it built in MYRA (satchel_rules.h SR5):
; its number, how many files it holds, its bytes in all, whether zxvd
; signed its recipe (1) or not yet (0), and when (ms since 1970, zxvd's
; clock).
^ZXSATCHEL(seq:i9) = files:i2! ^ bytes:i9! ^ signed:i1! ^ stamp:i15!
